WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.331
When my mom is busy, I help her out.

2
00:00:04.332 --> 00:00:10.292
Of course, I am the big sister.

3
00:00:10.293 --> 00:00:13.118
Hana: Mom, Hada is crying.

4
00:00:13.119 --> 00:00:16.690
Mom: Could you check his

5
00:00:16.691 --> 00:00:19.699
diaper? Hana: Oh! Can I change

6
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.925
it? Mom: Sure, go

7
00:00:22.926 --> 00:00:26.657
ahead. Hana: Bada, get me a fresh

8
00:00:26.658 --> 00:00:30.208
diaper! Bada: Can't you see I'm busy right

9
00:00:30.209 --> 00:00:31.702
now? Mom: Come on,

10
00:00:31.703 --> 00:00:36.273
Bada. Your sister cannot leave the baby alone.

11
00:00:36.274 --> 00:00:39.003
Bada: Here you

12
00:00:39.004 --> 00:00:42.618
go. Hana: Hada, say thank you to your big

13
00:00:42.619 --> 00:00:44.899
brother. Let me change your diaper.

14
00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:48.410
Be a good boy now. Hada

15
00:00:48.411 --> 00:00:51.483
is such a cute baby. He

16
00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:53.866
is different from Bada. He

17
00:00:53.867 --> 00:00:56.710
smiles and laughs a lot. He

18
00:00:56.711 --> 00:01:00.040
